    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "5CE2A60FFB6E7D47",
      "text": "The kiddos here formed their own li’l Pokémon\\nLeague?! That’s...weirdly uptight, but neato![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
