      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "B99411EABED1F6CA",
      "text": "Chat went nutso for my Terarium tour! ’Specially\\nwhen my li’l Magnemite hair-pair went on a\\r\\nbzzt-bzzt-smash rampage in Chargestone Cavern![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
