      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "47716A55F4999F77",
      "text": "Well, I’unno about you, but I’m thinkin’ let’s\\nseal this exclusivity deal! Contract tiiime![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
