      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "47716C55F499A2DD",
      "text": "So if we can’t contract it up, let’s con-trade it up!\\nWanna swap some Pokémon?![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
